the shared interrupt handler rga_isr() remains active indefinitely.

When the master device is unbound, rga->m2m_dev is freed:

drivers/media/platform/rockchip/rga/rga.c:rga_unbind() {
    ...
	v4l2_m2m_release(rga->m2m_dev);
    ...
