> > =C2=A0		return ret;
> > =C2=A0	}
>=20
> [Severity: Medium]
> If component_add() fails, does this bypass the pm_runtime_disable() clean=
up
> at the err_put_clk label?
>=20
> Returning directly instead of using a goto would leak the device's Runtim=
e
> PM usage counter.
>=20
> > =C2=A0	return 0;
> > +
> > +err_put_clk:
